N (XÁC SUẤT 15%)</strong></p><p><strong>For centuries, business models were anchored in physical spaces and tangible goods. But when technology started dissolving the walls of shops and replacing ownership with constant access, the ground shifted. Companies that once sold products now offer experiences and continuous connections. A rented film has morphed into an endless streaming library, and a one-time transaction into a subscription. This evolution reveals a deeper truth: innovation is no longer a supplement but the very skeleton of commerce. To survive, firms must weave digital tools into their core fabric, or risk being left behind.</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Redefining business models with technology</strong></p><p><br></p><p></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Focusing on ethical technology development<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Promoting digital skills training</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Over-reliance on automated systems<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Building inclusive digital ecosystems<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"6961350eb68874e7ee1af522","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:04:14.674Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"696135c2ebc384f5d31f66be":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>Workplaces no longer hum only with human voices; they now share space with silent partners made of code and circuits. These systems shoulder repetitive chores—scheduling, number crunching, data entry—allowing people to redirect their energy toward more creative pursuits. Factories report greater precision, offices experience faster decisions, and the promise of scale feels closer than ever. Yet even allies can unsettle: if workers are unprepared, the same tools that lighten the load may instead spark unease. The challenge is to ensure that automation enhances productivity without draining morale.</strong></p><p><br> .</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Focusing on ethical technology development<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Enhancing productivity through automation</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Concerns about cybersecurity risks<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Redefining business models with technology</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Promoting digital skills training<br></strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"696135c2ebc384f5d31f66be","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:07:14.391Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"696136704c4c82e4f729435f":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>A society rushing forward on a digital highway cannot afford passengers who lack the map. Coding, cybersecurity, and data analysis are no longer specialist luxuries but essential literacy. Schools blend these subjects with traditional lessons, and governments pour resources into academies meant to bridge gaps. For citizens, this lifelong education is both shield and passport, protecting them from exclusion while opening doors to opportunity. Without such preparation, technology risks creating a privileged few who sprint ahead and many others stranded on the roadside.</strong></p><p><br> </p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>Focusing on ethical technology development</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Building inclusive digital ecosystems</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Promoting digital skills training</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Over-reliance on automated systems</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Concerns about cybersecurity risks</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"696136704c4c82e4f729435f","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:10:09.000Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"696136d771e104de6173a233":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<strong>When organizations lean too heavily on machinery of logic, cracks begin to show. Algorithms, celebrated for their speed, sometimes replicate human bias in hidden ways. Automated hiring tools might quietly filter out strong candidates; predictive systems may fail spectacularly when conditions change. The more humans surrender decision-making, the more their own judgment dulls, like muscles left unused. Balance, then, is the key: machines can be efficient assistants, but wisdom lies in keeping people firmly at the helm to steer when formulas falter.</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>Enhancing productivity through automation</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Focusing on ethical technology development</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Building inclusive digital ecosystems</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Over-reliance on automated systems</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Concerns about cybersecurity risks</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"696136d771e104de6173a233","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:11:51.408Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69613746811df3f54c2383ad":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>The digital revolution opens doors, but each door also invites intruders. Hospitals frozen by ransomware, schools paralyzed by stolen data—such headlines reveal how fragile online systems can be. What once seemed a purely technical nuisance has grown into a strategic threat that can cripple entire sectors. Protecting networks now requires not only firewalls and passwords, but also culture, training, and swift response plans. Without them, the gains of digital adoption may dissolve into distrust, leaving behind not progress but financial loss and reputational scars.</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Promoting digital skills training</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Enhancing productivity through automation</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Focusing on ethical technology development</strong></p><p></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Building inclusive digital ecosystems</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Concerns about cybersecurity risks</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"69613746811df3f54c2383ad","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:13:42.022Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"696137b920cbb3d42e44d951":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>Technology’s promise shines brightest when it does not belong solely to the powerful. Broadband in rural towns, free Wi-Fi in public squares, and collaborative platforms for small enterprises—all of these initiatives aim to ensure no one is excluded from the digital age. When ecosystems are designed inclusively, innovation becomes a shared endeavor, not a private privilege. But this requires effort: corporations and governments must look beyond profit to consider communities at the margins, where a single connection can change countless futures.</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Building inclusive digital ecosystems</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Focusing on ethical technology development</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Over-reliance on automated systems</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Promoting digital skills training</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Enhancing productivity through automation</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"696137b920cbb3d42e44d951","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2026-01-09T17:15:37.052Z","updated":"2026-01-09T17:17:44.920Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"69613832e3a4d35ae30a8bee":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>Every new tool whispers questions beyond its function. Who owns the data? Whose rights are safeguarded, and whose are overlooked? Artificial intelligence may quicken decisions, but it can also entrench inequality if unchecked. Some firms now adopt codes of fairness, attempting to weigh social impact alongside profit margins. Trust, once broken, is difficult to rebuild; yet trust is exactly what sustains long-term innovation. Ethical reflection is therefore not decoration but foundation—ensuring that digital progress uplifts rather than exploits.</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;Redefining business models with technology</strong></p><p><br></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":